# SourceTarget byte ranges address the Git object bytes. Platform checkout
# conversion would change those identities, so repository-backed UTF-8
# sources and their exact-byte fixtures stay LF.
# Every vendored corpus, not one game's copy of one: corpora/ is where
# they all live and a new one must not have to remember this line.
corpora/**/*.md text eol=lf
tests/fixtures/source_partition/*.md text eol=lf
